OL,5,G0630 Dan Walker
OL,6,     FDan Walker has the perfect
OL,7,     Fclassical music to get you up in
OL,8,     Fthe morning, with all the news and
OL,9,     Ftravel updates you need to know
OL,10,     Ffor the day ahead, plus the Hall
OL,11,     Fof Fame Hour at 9am.
OL,12,G0900 The Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
OL,13,     FDan Walker brings you an hour of
OL,14,     Fthe biggest classical hits from
OL,15,     Fthe Classic FM Hall of Fame - the
OL,16,     Fannual Top 300 chart voted for by
OL,17,     Fyou.
